{"results":[{"name":"Aesop","entity_id":"32F867B9-E6DF-44C3-BCE4-40160C7ED5E4","types":["urn:entity:brand"],"properties":{"akas":[{"language":"ja","value":"イソップ (ブランド)"}],"description":"Established in 1987, this brand offers a meticulously curated range of skin, hair, and body care products formulated with high-quality botanical and laboratory-made ingredients. Its identity is defined by a commitment to scientific precision, intellectual rigor, and an uncompromising focus on design, reflected in both its iconic amber packaging and its unique, architecturally bespoke retail spaces. The brand appeals to a global, design-conscious audience that values an elevated, sensory-driven grooming experience. Operating as a Certified B Corporation, it maintains a strong focus on ethical sourcing and cruelty-free practices.","external":{"instagram":{"id":"aesopskincare"},"twitter":{"id":"aesopskincare"},"wikidata":{"id":"Q4688560"}},"founded_year":"1987","image":{"url":"https://images.qloo.com/i/32F867B9-E6DF-44C3-BCE4-40160C7ED5E4-420x-auto.jpg"},"short_description":"Aesop is an Australian luxury brand known for its vegan, cruelty-free skincare, haircare, and fragrance products.","short_descriptions":[{"language":"fr","value":"Une maison de luxe dédiée aux soins de la peau et aux parfums, reconnue pour ses formulations botaniques scientifiquement éprouvées et le design unique de ses boutiques."},{"language":"de","value":"Eine Luxusmarke für Hautpflege und Düfte, bekannt für ihre wissenschaftlich fundierten Formulierungen auf pflanzlicher Basis und ihre architektonisch inspirierten Ladendesigns."},{"language":"en","value":"A luxury skincare and fragrance house known for its scientifically-backed, plant-based formulations and highly distinct, architecturally-inspired store designs."},{"language":"es","value":"Una marca de lujo de cuidado de la piel y fragancias conocida por sus fórmulas botánicas con base científica y por sus diseños de tiendas distintivos inspirados en la arquite